                            </table></section><section class="page-break"><h2>Löneläget och statistiken mot ställningstagandet</h2><table id="ref-tabell" class="data-table" aria-label="Löneläget och statistiken mot ställningstagandet per yrkesgrupp"><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="sortable">Yrkesgrupp</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">n</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P10 (kr/mån)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Median (kr/mån)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P90 (kr/mån)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P10 mot ställn. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Median mot ställn. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P90 mot ställn. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P10 mot stat. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Median mot stat. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">P90 mot stat. (%)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Läge (ställn. · stat.)</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Mönster</th><th scope="col" class="sortable">Förslag på referens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2000 Ingenjör · BAS C</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="14">14</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="35755">35&nbsp;755</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="36675">36&nbsp;675</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="37455">37&nbsp;455</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="19.18">+19,2 %</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="9.48">+9,5 %</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="-3.96">−4,0 %</td><td class="num muted" data-sort-value="">–</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="0.48">+0,5 %</td><td class="num muted" data-sort-value="">–</td><td data-sort-value="74.16666666666667">i övre delen (74) · –</td><td>löneläget inom ställningstagandet, statistiken också inom</td><td>Ställningstagandet: löneläget ligger inom ställningstagandet</td></tr><tr><td>4100 Tekniker · BAS B</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="17">17</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="32660">32&nbsp;660</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="33500">33&nbsp;500</td><td class="num" data-sort-value="341